    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102110" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωφρον-ιστήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωφρονιστής</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Ma.</u>
				27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pl.,
				<i>wisdom-teeth</i> (= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραντῆρες</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Carn.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cleanth.Stoic.
				1.118
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωφρονιστὴρ λίθος</span> at Thebes, which
				<i>restored reason</i> to Heracles, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				9.11.2
			</span></i>.</div>
